    "type": "question",
    "label": "3",
    "prompt": "Three cyclists, Jim, Sam and Ben, set out from the same starting point to travel home.\nThe graph shows the distance from home of each cyclist for the first 2 hours of their journey.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [
      {
        "id": "p51-q3-graph",
        "role": "question",
        "format": "tikz",
        "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[{\"name\":\"jimOrange\",\"hex\":\"EF8B2C\",\"reason\":\"Jim's journey and matching label\"},{\"name\":\"samGreen\",\"hex\":\"4F9B63\",\"reason\":\"Sam's journey and matching label\"},{\"name\":\"benPurple\",\"hex\":\"8B5CC7\",\"reason\":\"Ben's journey and matching label\"},{\"name\":\"gridBlue\",\"hex\":\"268CFF\",\"reason\":\"graph grid\"}],\"reference\":\"source page 51, p51-q3-graph\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=2.65cm,y=0.045cm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\definecolor{jimOrange}{HTML}{EF8B2C}\n\\definecolor{samGreen}{HTML}{4F9B63}\n\\definecolor{benPurple}{HTML}{8B5CC7}\n\\definecolor{gridBlue}{HTML}{268CFF}\n\\definecolor{graphGrid}{HTML}{D4E8FF}\n\\draw[step={(0.1,5)},graphGrid,line width=0.15pt] (0,0) grid (2.2,105);\n\\foreach \\x in {0.5,1,1.5,2} {\\draw[graphGrid,line width=0.25pt] (\\x,0)--(\\x,105);}\n\\foreach \\y in {10,20,...,100} {\\draw[graphGrid,line width=0.25pt] (0,\\y)--(2.2,\\y);}\n\\draw[black,->,line width=0.5pt] (0,0)--(2.2,0);\n\\draw[black,->,line width=0.5pt] (0,0)--(0,105);\n\\foreach \\x in {0.5,1,1.5,2} {\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] (\\x,0)--++(0,-1.8);\\node[below=3pt,text=black] at (\\x,0) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}\\x\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\foreach \\y in {0,10,...,100} {\\draw[black,line width=0.4pt] (0,\\y)--++(-0.035,0);\\node[left=3pt,text=black] at (0,\\y) {\\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text=\"tick\">}\\y\\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}\n\\node[below=18pt,text=black] at (1.1,0) {Time (h)};\n\\node[rotate=90,text=black] at (-0.36,52.5) {Distance from home (km)};\n\\node[above=4pt,text=black] at (1.1,105) {Comparing three journeys};\n\\draw[jimOrange,line width=0.8pt] (0,90)--(2,70);\n\\draw[samGreen,line width=0.8pt] (0,90)--(2,50);\n\\draw[benPurple,line width=0.8pt] (0,90)--(2,30);\n\\fill[jimOrange] (2,70) circle[radius=1.4pt];\n\\fill[samGreen] (2,50) circle[radius=1.4pt];\n\\fill[benPurple] (2,30) circle[radius=1.4pt];\n\\node[above left=2pt,text=jimOrange] at (2,70) {Jim};\n\\node[above left=2pt,text=samGreen] at (2,50) {Sam};\n\\node[above left=2pt,text=benPurple] at (2,30) {Ben};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
